{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09673","headline":"火山云歌送别 · 岑参","name":"火山云歌送别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火山突兀赤亭口，火山五月火云厚。\n火云满山凝未开，飞鸟千里不敢来。\n平明乍逐胡风断，薄暮浑随塞雨回。\n缭绕斜吞铁关树，氛氲半掩交河戍。\n迢迢征路火山东，山上孤云随马去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09673.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09673","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"黄全彦"}